plots/** linguist-vendored

# Bruker timsTOF raw data — binary, never diff or merge these.
*.tdf_bin binary
*.tdf binary

# mzML is XML, but `indexListOffset` and every `offset` in its indexList are BYTE
# offsets into this exact file. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# LF to CRLF, which shifts every offset and makes a reader rebuild the index from the
# document - mzmlpy >=0.10.3 warns when it does, and pytest's filterwarnings=error
# turns that warning into an error in every mzML fixture. Keep the bytes verbatim.
*.mzML -text
*.mzml -text

# Lockfile is machine-generated; keep it out of diffs and language stats.
uv.lock -diff linguist-generated
